  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the duck fat and let it melt.",
    "Add the duck breast and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the bhuna spice blend and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fish sauce, lime juice, and brown sugar, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Cook the rice noodles according to package instructions.",
    "Assemble the bun cha by placing the noodles in a bowl, topping with the duck and sauce, and garnishing with bean sprouts, mint leaves, and basil leaves.",
